loop update pending UPDATING
ServiceManager -> OCI: GetProtectionPolicy
end
end
ServiceManager -> OCI: run helper hooks\ncreate=tfresource.CreateResource\nentity=ProtectionPolicy\naction=CreateProtectionPolicy;\nupdate=tfresource.UpdateResource\nentity=ProtectionPolicy\naction=UpdateProtectionPolicy;\ndelete=tfresource.DeleteResource\nentity=ProtectionPolicy\naction=DeleteProtectionPolicy
ServiceManager -> OCI: apply follow-up strategy\ncreate=workrequest;\nupdate=workrequest;\ndelete=confirm-delete
end
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: status=required,\nfinalizer=retain-until-confirmed-delete
end
